            "t": "p",
            "text": "All other terms of the Existing Agreement remain unchanged, including payment deadlines, Company-paid transfer and conversion fees, and applicable mandatory protections. This Addendum does not change payment dates; any agreement to change those dates must separately identify the old and new schedule, effective date, and required acceptance, and must not override a legal payment deadline. The parties receive a retrievable copy and preserve the original signed documents."
